{
  "summary": "Stop-loss rules for Corvale Planters' new TikTok and Pinterest ads at a $40 target per purchase, tested on 2026-07-29 to 2026-10-26. Recommended setting: 5% confidence. A new ad stops once spend passes $120.00 with no purchase, $189.60 with one, $252.00 with two or $310.00 with three, or when its click rate stays under half the platform's median with no purchase. It leaves the watch after 3 purchases at or under $40. On the last 90 days this stops 4 of 5 losing ads and none of the 5 winners. Today: 1 ad to stop, 1 on watch.",
