  "findings": [
    "At 5% confidence the rules stop 4 of 5 losing ads and none of the 5 winners, and save $1,024.61 of spend for 0 lost purchases (net $1,024.61 at the $40 target).",
    "Quicker settings cost winners: 10% stops Self-watering pot demo and 20% stops Self-watering pot demo and Pothos propagation tip. Both started slowly and finished under $40 a purchase.",
    "The click-rate floor only acts on ads with no purchase. Without that gate it would have stopped Ridge planter idea pin, a winner with a 0.25% click rate that sold at $29.81 a purchase.",
    "The click-rate floor stopped Plant shelf voiceover on day 3, 1 day before the spend rule would have, saving $29.88 more.",
    "Before and after balcony was never stopped: 15 purchases at $53.67 each is 34% over target, too close for a stop-loss to call. Judge it as a bid or creative question, not a stop.",
    "The overspend rule fires once: Prospecting | Planters spent $356.54 on 2026-08-12 against a $250.00 daily cap ($106.54 above it)."
  ],
